{"id":"571457cbee377421","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness.md","title":"GL for Omega Provability in Analysis","display":"thm-analysis-omega-completeness — GL for Omega Provability in Analysis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness"],"display":"thm-analysis-omega-completeness — GL for Omega Provability in Analysis","depends_on":["[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analysis-omega-completeness — GL for Omega Provability in Analysis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"508219e8b4c7dadf\" href=\"?note=508219e8b4c7dadf\" title=\"89-df-analysis-omega-theory\">89-df-analysis-omega-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(x)\">\\(O(x)\\)</span> 是二阶算术中自然表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)\\)</span> 句子码集合的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span> 公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2\">\\(r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{O,r}\">\\(\\tau_{O,r}\\)</span> 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、布尔联结词，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{O,r}(\\Box A)=O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau_{O,r}(\\Box A)=O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\urcorner})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在通常元理论中采用标准二阶结构的可靠性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为单模态定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\ \n(\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}))\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\\n(\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\ \n(\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}))\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\\n(\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 14 章，印刷页 178–186；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书 Theorem 1。这里盒解释为完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则可证性，而第一个目标仍是普通分析可证性；不把两种可证关系等同。来源证明先在分析中验证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 的派生条件，后以递归序数记号及同时对角化构造反解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span> 性来自对所有满足闭包条件的句子集作二阶量化；这一高阶集合量词不是 PA 的量词。本条为来源支持的定理陈述，序数记号的基础理论尚未逐原子展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","status":"resolved","id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"O(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{O,r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{O,r}(\\Box A)=O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\ \n(\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}))\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\\n(\\tau_{O,r}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":1813,"backlinks":[{"id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]] → [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] → [[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["508219e8b4c7dadf","0006800fa1c85177"]}